          \label{eq:2}
          \Phi f = \int_\Delta f \ dE \quad (f \in L^\infty(E)).
        \end{equation}
        Explicitly, $\Phi$ is linear and multiplicative and satisfies
        \[
          \Phi(\bar{f}) = (\Phi f)^*, \| \Phi f \| = \| f \|_{\infty} \quad (f \in L^\infty(E)).
